WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:17.374
"We're having a yard sale," said Dad.

2
00:00:17.375 --> 00:00:24.040
"We can sell our old things," said Mom.

3
00:00:24.041 --> 00:00:31.092
Harry found some old puzzles and plastic soldiers.

4
00:00:31.093 --> 00:00:39.196
"I don't play with this stuff anymore," he said.

5
00:00:39.197 --> 00:00:42.239
Emmy found some board games and dolls.

6
00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.437
"These toys are old too," she said.

7
00:00:46.438 --> 00:00:56.758
Oliver was still looking for something to sell.

8
00:00:56.759 --> 00:01:02.003
"What about that dump truck?" asked Mom.

9
00:01:02.004 --> 00:01:05.134
"No," said Oliver.

10
00:01:05.135 --> 00:01:09.238
"It's good at dumping sand."

11
00:01:09.239 --> 00:01:12.338
"What about this rubber ball?" asked Dad.

12
00:01:12.339 --> 00:01:15.000
"No," said Oliver.

13
00:01:15.001 --> 00:01:21.972
"It bounces really high."

14
00:01:21.973 --> 00:01:24.709
Soon it was eight o'clock.

15
00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:30.069
It was time for the yard sale!

16
00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:32.950
Oliver picked up his green alligator.

17
00:01:32.951 --> 00:01:36.114
"This is a baby toy," he thought.

18
00:01:36.115 --> 00:01:39.843
"I guess I can sell it."

19
00:01:39.844 --> 00:01:44.609
The yard sale was very busy.

20
00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:50.393
Mom sold some blue dishes and old clothes.

21
00:01:50.394 --> 00:01:54.889
Dad sold all his fishing rods.

22
00:01:54.890 --> 00:02:01.356
Emmy and Harry sold their toys.

23
00:02:01.357 --> 00:02:04.860
Then a little girl picked up Oliver's alligator.

24
00:02:04.861 --> 00:02:08.884
"This alligator is so cute!" she said.

25
00:02:08.885 --> 00:02:11.668
The little girl bought the alligator.

26
00:02:11.669 --> 00:02:15.999
Oliver felt terrible.

27
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:21.097
"I like that alligator," he thought.

28
00:02:21.098 --> 00:02:24.605
The next day Dad and Oliver took a walk.

29
00:02:24.606 --> 00:02:35.431
"Look," said Dad. "It's a yard sale!"

30
00:02:35.432 --> 00:02:38.087
Oliver found a new toy.

31
00:02:38.088 --> 00:02:42.906
"Look what I bought, Dad!" he said.

32
00:02:42.907 --> 00:02:49.401
"A green alligator!"
